accessor writeBigInt64BE : write 8 signed big
accessor writeBigUInt64LE : write 8 unsigned little
accessor writeBigUInt64BE : write 8 unsigned big
accessor writeBigUint64LE : write 8 unsigned little
accessor writeBigUint64BE : write 8 unsigned big

